# Pioneers of Pagonia on macOS via Madeira: findings repo. Only documents, scripts, patches
# and screenshots are tracked. Everything below is either game content (copyrighted, must not
# be redistributed), Apple binaries (D3DMetal / Metal Shader Converter output, licence-bound),
# or bulky runtime output that the documents summarise.

